menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_SCREEN_SURFACE
    bool "Enable screen expressions, animations, point-to-read and video"
    default n
    help
        Runs the bounded screen-surface policy and helpers: facial expressions,
        built-in animation clips, a point-to-read dictionary and clamped video
        playback plans. A device without a display simply does not link the
        component.

endmenu
